WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.126
My plan had

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:05.046
originally been to enlist in the Army
and then use that to pay for college.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.800
Once I found out about QuestBridge
and the generous financial aid

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:12.262
the colleges like Yale have,
that sort of changed my plans.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:13.972
I focused on QuestBridge

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:18.309
because the profile of students
that they described was exactly who I was.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:21.396
It was nice to just have it established

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:24.607
through applying through QuestBridge
that I was first generation low income.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:28.319
I wasn't trying to fit
into a mold of different activities

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:30.447
or things that weren't
even accessible in my high school.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:35.660
It allowed me to present who I am more
than just what I've done academically.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.706
The day I was accepted to Yale I was like,
Wait, no way, this is a prank.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.915
And then I was like, Wait, no, it's not.

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:41.916
I'm running through my house.

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.918
And I'm like, Mom, Mom look,
you know, look

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:45.879
you kind of feel like, okay, I'm
going to be

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.548
the only one who's the first person
to go to college in their family.

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:50.717
The only one from a small town.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.885
But when you get here, you see that

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:55.180
there's thousands of other people
with the same, same experience, you know?

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.309
The Quest Scholars network at Yale
has truly become my family.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:02.353
Just knowing that everyone has gone
through similar things

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:04.397
as me is comforting.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.815
It is a shared identity

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:10.153
that, you know, hundreds of students
come to campus having and the Quest Scholars

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:13.823
Network is a place for them
to build a little home within Yale.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:15.283
It's been very valuable

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:18.703
in terms of finding a community
where I felt at home and not out of place.

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:22.999
I felt like I really found a place that I
fit in at, a sort of home away from home.

00:01:23.374 --> 00:01:26.086
I've never felt,
you know, like I didn't belong here.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:30.256
It is hard, but it's worth it
because Yale is the best thing

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.007
that's ever happened to me.

